{"quest_id": 4364, "name": "紅の包囲網", "description": "骨片の守り手であるドワーフの洞窟を\n紅の鎧の軍勢が取り囲む……。\n知略を駆使し、劣勢を打開せよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "風水士と紅の教団", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920049, "map_no": 3610, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 65, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 23, "level": 90, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097712, "master_id": 40, "global_id": 39}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101536, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 316, "global_id": 315, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "level": 90, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 261, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098480, "missile_id": 41, "missile": {"speed": 4.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 98, "global_id": 97, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 49}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "教団員", "text": "この奥に魔神ロノベ様の骨片があるようだ。", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "おい、中にいるんだろう。出てこい！\n大人しく渡せば命だけは助けてやる。", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ドロシー", "text": "あんなこと言ってるけどどうする？", "face": "u132"}, {"name": "ライチ", "text": "この骨片は、ボクたちドワーフが護るように\nご先祖様が預かったもの。\n誰がお前たちになんか渡すもんか！", "face": "u256"}, {"name": "ドロシー", "text": "どうせ骨片渡しても見逃す気なんてないくせに。", "face": "u132"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "……なんだと……っ。子供の分際で……！！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ライチ", "text": "子供じゃないよ。これでもボクたちは大人だよ。\n悪いけどこれはボクたちで護り抜いてみせるっ。", "face": "u256"}, {"name": "ドロシー", "text": "その通り。小っちゃくたって私の斧で\n頭かち割ってやるもん！", "face": "u132"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "報告！\nドワーフたちの洞窟が敵に包囲されています！", "face": "l6852db1335ce"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "大変です！　今すぐ助けにいきましょう！", "face": "l3b5e59a6cf4b"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ライチ", "text": "助けてくれてありがとう。助かったよ。", "face": "u256"}, {"name": "ドロシー", "text": "私たちだけでも大丈夫だったけど……。\nでもまぁ、ありがとう。", "face": "u132"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ふふっ。無事でよかったです。"}]}], "active": true}